  "title": "Semantic-Critical Regions for Video-to-Audio Generation",
  "summary": "This report introduces SCR-V2A, a V2A generation framework that explicitly localizes and encodes Semantic-Critical Regions (SCRs) as fine-grained visual guidance for audio generation. The method improves performance in distribution matching and audio quality while remaining competitive in cross-modal alignment, addressing the limitations of existing V2A methods by focusing on fine-grained sound-relevant visual cues.",
  "facts": [
