      "statement": "SCR-V2A introduces explicit localization of sound-relevant visual evidence as a control representation.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The method uses adapter-based dual visual encoding to jointly capture global context and fine-grained sound evidence.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Experiments on both in-domain and out-of-domain benchmarks demonstrate strong performance in distribution matching and audio quality.",
